                "loc": "LEV.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 19.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Pien cik mogo ma waco ni, “Pe itim abor, pe ineki, pe ikwal, cwinyi pe opukke i kom jami pa ŋat mukene,” ki kwa cik mogo mukene-gu gucokke kacel ki lok man ni, “Mar lawoti macalo imarre keni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋat ma maro dano, pe timo gin marac bot dano lawote; pi meno mar aye ma cobo cik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuti man kun wuŋeyo kare ma wutye iye, ni, kare doŋ oromo myero wuco woko ki i waŋ nino. Pien larrewa doŋ onyiko cok twatwal, kato ma i kare ma yam wakwoŋo ye iye Rwot-ti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dyewor doŋ cok tum, piny doŋ mito ru. Doŋ wabolu tic me piny macol woko, waruku jami lweny me dyeceŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myero walubu kit ma myero me dyeceŋ, laboŋo maro tuko marac me yomcwiny marac, ki mero, laboŋo timo abor ki tim mogo me tarwaŋ, laboŋo daa ki nyeko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuruk Rwot Yecu Kricito calo wuruko boŋowu, dok bene pe wutam pi kwowu me kit pa dano ma ginywalowu kwede pi cobo mitte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
